OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer who called 999 saw 'large
OL,4,Agroup of hooded and masked men' near
OL,5,ARAF Fairford, she tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe farmer says she called 999 at 01:36
OL,8,FBST. "Within 10 minutes the village was
OL,9,Ffull of armed police. I think it was
OL,10,Fpure luck that I arrived in the village
OL,11,Fat a similar time to the vans"
OL,13,FThe farmer says the authorities
OL,14,F"dropped the ball" - although Defence
OL,15,FSecretary Wes Streeting says she only
OL,16,Fhas a "partial picture"
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,348,340,200,160,0,100
PN,34703
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F347A1790580349
OL,1,W5j 5Q555pjsjjj js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q--% (.*.. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,!
OL,3,GNEWSAFarmer who called 999 saw 'large
OL,4,Agroup of hooded and masked men' near
OL,5,ARAF Fairford, she tells BBC
OL,6,
OL,7,FGloucestershire Police say they were
OL,8,Falerted at about 00:45 BST on Sunday.
OL,9,FFive men remain in custody - they were
OL,10,Farrested under the Explosives Act, and
OL,11,Fon suspicion of preparing a terrorist
OL,12,Fact
OL,14,FRAF Fairford, in the Cotswolds, is used
OL,15,Fby the US military. President Trump
OL,16,Fsays the US had the five men "under
OL,17,Fview for a long time, and we got them"
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/3
